 "texts": {
  "article": "Welcome to Portmere Language Center. Come to the front desk. Say your name. Spell it slowly. Get your student card. Look at your name on the card. Is it correct? Find your group. Your group is on the board. Group 1 is in Room 2. Group 2 is in Room 4. Ask questions. Your teacher is here to help you. Every student has questions in week one.",
  "real_lives": "My name is Nadia Rahman. Nadia is my first name. Rahman is my last name. I am from Tabriz. I am a student at Portmere Language Center. My group is Group 2. My classroom is Room 4. My teacher is Ms Nkemelu. My notebook is new and my pens are blue. It is a good first day.",
  "case": "Blanca is a new student at Portmere Language Center. On Monday she spells her name at the front desk: B-L-A-N-C-A. On Tuesday her student card is ready. But the name on the card is Blanka. It is wrong. Blanca needs the card for the library today. She is shy, and this is her third question this week."
 },
